oms 1
// Verita (戦女神VERITA) ADV prelude (spec §11.2): the speaker table, the dialogue line template, the scene
// header's handlers and the library its scenes link. Drafted 2026-11-25 from the core decompile of every SC and
// SP scene: the header from SC0000 (237 of 240 scenes carry it unchanged), each library sub from the first scene
// that links it, as many copies as one scene carries. Sub names describe behaviour as read then; the families
// that differ only in a duration, a colour or a list of steps carry those in their names. Maintained by hand
// since.
module verita.adv
use verita.scripts

// Speaker ids: the index into CNINIT's names (GS[0x1b6]), the ones the scenes set. Names that are not
// identifiers (？？？？) and repeated names carry their id.
